                <head>466. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On April 2, President Eisenhower approved NSC 5809, “U.S. Policy in Mainland
                    Southeast Asia,” which superseded NSC 5612/1, September 5, 1956. For text, see
                        <ref target="frus:frus1955-57v21/pg_252"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1955–1957, volume XXI, pages 252</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1955-57v21/pg_263">263</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
